<title>PHILIPPINES: Jollibee Jan-Mar net up by 10 percent.</title>
<headline>Jollibee Jan-Mar net up by 10 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues (billion)	    1.920 vs 1.403</p>
<p>    Net income			121.094 vs 109.818</p>
<p>Note: Full name Jollibee Foods Corporation. Company said it had opened eight more stores in the country in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-62-67</p>
